#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.desktop.in:3
#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Resizer"
msgstr "Resizer"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.desktop.in:4
msgid "Resizer App"
msgstr "Resizer-app"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.desktop.in:5
msgid "Image resizer"
msgstr "Afbeeldingen herschalen"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.desktop.in:11
msgid "Image;resize;"
msgstr "Afbeelding;herschalen;formaat;"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Quickly resize images"
msgstr "Snel afbeeldingen herschalen"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Resizer is a simple, native elementary OS app for resizing one or more "
"images at once. It always maintains the aspect ratio and never upscales "
"images."
msgstr ""
"Resizer is een eenvoudige, native elementary OS-app waarmee je één of "
"meerdere afbeeldingen tegelijk kunt herschalen. De beeldverhouding blijft "
"altijd behouden en afbeeldingen worden nooit vergroot."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Functies:"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Open images with Resizer or open Resizer and Drag and drop images"
msgstr ""
"Open afbeeldingen met Resizer, of open Resizer en sleep er afbeeldingen in"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Maintains aspect ratio."
msgstr "Behoudt de beeldverhouding."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Keyboard control: Change the sizes using the up and down keys, press enter "
"to resize."
msgstr ""
"Toetsenbordbediening: wijzig de afmetingen met de pijltjestoetsen omhoog en "
"omlaag, druk op enter om te herschalen."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Settings are stored for next time."
msgstr "Instellingen worden onthouden voor de volgende keer."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "It supports the following image formats:"
msgstr "Het ondersteunt de volgende afbeeldingsformaten:"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:25
msgid "JPEG"
msgstr "JPEG"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid "PNG"
msgstr "PNG"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:27
msgid "BMP"
msgstr "BMP"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:28
msgid "TIFF"
msgstr "TIFF"

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:59
